#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A persistent dock exposes every feature: Audio, Video, File and Game. Each feature opens its own panel, and panels stack so several activities can run together."
msgstr "A persistent dock exposes every feature: Audio, Video, File and Game. Each feature opens its own panel, and panels stack so several activities can run together."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_universal_lobby.html.heex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Audio and video are self-controlled: each peer turns their own microphone and camera on or off independently, like a modern video call. There is no separate consent to start a call."
msgstr "Audio and video are self-controlled: each peer turns their own microphone and camera on or off independently, like a modern video call. There is no separate consent to start a call."

